<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sets dollar sell tender in commercial mkt.</title>
<headline>Brazil sets dollar sell tender in commercial mkt.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank announced a dollar sell tender in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The real was quoted at 1.0285 per dollar before the Central Bank announced the auction.</p>
<p>-- Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo Newsroom 55-11-2324411</p>
</text>
